Section: 1 Introduction
Text: {xuta, taoqin}@microsoft.com Ghader and Monz, 2017; Domhan, 2018; Tang et al., 2018), few works concentrate on the char- acteristics and functionalities of the encoder and the decoder, which are valuable to understand this popular framework and improve its performance in NMT. Therefore, in this paper, we conduct a study and aim to understand the characteristics of the encoder and the decoder in NMT. We observe some interesting phenomena: • The decoder handles an easier task than the encoder.

